OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FEarly
OL,6,Fevening showers easing to leave a
OL,7,Fmostly dry night with clear spells.
OL,8,FWinds also easing a little by morning
OL,9,Fand feeling cooler overnight with
OL,10,Frural spots into the single figures.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FDry at first, but increasingly
OL,13,Fcloudy as rain moves in from the west
OL,14,Fduring the afternoon. Possibly turning
OL,15,Fheavy for a time, with winds
OL,16,Fincreasing into the afternoon also.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
